<title>UK: Westhyp sets 240 mln mark Corex linked bond.</title>
<headline>Westhyp sets 240 mln mark Corex linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank AG and Landesbank Hessen-Thuringen.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    240 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.60	MATURITY    28.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE     REX LINKED  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    FFM	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *LINKED TO THE REX 10-YEAR INDEX TIMES 81 PCT ON A</p>
<p>		30/360 DAY BASIS.</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
